  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a2598e857b284925a344cfeb3fb12f50, type: 3}
  m_Name: Linh_ArchaeologistSOS
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  speakerName: LINH
  portrait: {fileID: -1297769870653861099, guid: b2dcf0c911c6cdd4ea996aa2005d4ebb, type: 3}
  continuePrompt: C to continue
  closePrompt: C to finish
  lines:
  - english: Agent K1, this is Linh. You cleared the monsters around the tower.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EB7c v\u1EE5 K1, Linh \u0111\xE2y. Anh \u0111\xE3 h\u1EA1
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\xF3m qu\xE1i quanh t\xF2a th\xE1p."
  - english: I am receiving a distress signal from an archaeologist near the station.
    vietnamese: "T\xF4i v\u1EEBa nh\u1EADn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\xEDn hi\u1EC7u c\u1EA7u
      c\u1EE9u c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t nh\xE0 kh\u1EA3o c\u1ED5 g\u1EA7n nh\xE0 ga."
  - english: A monster is guarding his hiding place. Go there and defeat it.
    vietnamese: "C\xF3 qu\xE1i v\u1EADt canh gi\u1EEF n\u01A1i \xF4ng \u1EA5y \u0111ang
      tr\u1ED1n. H\xE3y \u0111\u1EBFn \u0111\xF3 v\xE0 h\u1EA1 n\xF3."
  - english: Then speak to the archaeologist. He may know more about the tower and
      these monsters.
    vietnamese: "Sau \u0111\xF3 h\xE3y n\xF3i chuy\u1EC7n v\u1EDBi nh\xE0 kh\u1EA3o
      c\u1ED5. \xD4ng \u1EA5y c\xF3 th\u1EC3 bi\u1EBFt th\xEAm th\xF4ng tin v\u1EC1
      t\xF2a th\xE1p v\xE0 l\u0169 qu\xE1i v\u1EADt."
